  "premise_review": [
    "HFunctionFamily is merely a supplied Type, not a constructed analytic H-function or indexed function family. Time and ZeroIndex are arbitrary supplied types; zeroPosition really is Time → ZeroIndex → Real.",
    "backwardsHeatEquation and newmanLambdaNonnegative are arbitrary independently selected Prop fields, each with its own supplied proof. No equation, Lambda field or numerical inequality is encoded by those labels in this source.",
    "RodgersTaoZeroDynamics F has an actual velocity : F.Time → F.ZeroIndex → Real. repulsionLaw and arithmeticProgressionLimit are independent Props without proofs. localEquilibriumConclusion has a supplied proof, with no relation linking it to velocity, positions, repulsion, a topology or arithmetic progression.",
    "All three source theorem bodies are genuine direct projections of the corresponding supplied certification fields. They do not independently construct a PDE solution, prove a Newman bound, establish the Rodgers–Tao theorem, or derive equilibrium.",
    "The captured DeBruijnNewmanBridge context has separate real Lambda/data fields and independent bridge propositions; its real fields do not silently supply missing meaning to this record. Its own enum inequality proof is context-only, not counted as a primary theorem here."
  ],
  "split_decision": {
    "decision": "WHOLE_MIXED_SOURCE_EXACT_ARCHIVE_ONLY",
    "conceptual_seams": [
      "Complete supplied carrier/position data plus certified named heat/Newman proposition interface",
      "Complete velocity data plus unlinked repulsion/equilibrium/arithmetic-progression interface",
      "Three genuine certified-Prop projection proof commands"
    ],
    "reason": "Typed functions are real source content, but extracting them by replacing the complete mixed record with a smaller type would alter its fields; extracting the source-local proof consequences would need a new legacy self-provider import. Preserve all complete commands and their genuine proof terms exactly without strengthening the analytic names."
  },
  "disposition": "EXACT_ARCHIVE_ONLY_COMPLETE_MIXED_HEAT_DYNAMICS_SCHEMAS_AND_THREE_GENUINE_SUPPLIED_PROP_PROOFS",
  "review_notes": [
    "Full original1642B and organized3256B read separately. Historical organization adds status text and an outer namespace; every original command remains visible and archived.",
